OL,3,GNEWSAManhunt for suspect with 'altered
OL,4,Aappearance'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are hunting a man who they say
OL,7,F"significantly altered his appearance"
OL,8,Fsince being captured on CCTV at the
OL,9,Ftime of a fatal pub shooting in north
OL,10,FLondon.
OL,12,FErdem Mustafa, 35, was shot dead in
OL,13,FHertford Road, Enfield, last Monday.
OL,15,FMetropolitan Police want to trace
OL,16,FAbreham Woldegiworgis, 35, who they
OL,17,Fbelieve is the person captured in CCTV
OL,18,Ffootage wearing a grey beanie and a
OL,19,Fbright orange wig.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
