OL,3,GNEWSAManhunt for suspect with 'altered
OL,4,Aappearance'
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland Yard released "before" and
OL,7,F"after" images of him on Monday in an
OL,8,Fappeal for information. The force said
OL,9,Fboth images show the same person with
OL,10,Fand without a beard.
